 R←Test_Dir2_050(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;path;qdmx
⍝ Test the `Dir2` method recursively on a tree that contains at least one folder with right limitations
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 :If 'Win'≢APLTreeUtils2.GetOperatingSystem ⍬
     R←T._WindowsOnly
 :Else
     path←(WinSys.ExpandEnv'%SYSTEMROOT%'),'\system32\*'
     :Trap 19
         {}('recurse' 1)##.FilesAndDirs.Dir2 path
         →T.FailsIf 1
     :Else
         qdmx←⎕DMX
         →T.PassesIf∨/'Unable to scan directory'⍷qdmx.EM
     :EndTrap

     R←T._OK
 :EndIf
